<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer details nine-month orders.</title>
<headline>Sulzer details nine-month orders.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p>Group orders received	  4,153 vs 4,252</p>
<p>Sulzer Roteq			 959 vs   895</p>
<p>Sulzer Rueti			 456 vs   585</p>
<p>Sulzer Winterthur		  742 vs   884</p>
